## File Responsibilities

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `{{ feature_name }}Controller.cs` | HTTP endpoints — maps `Result<T>` to HTTP responses; no business logic |
| `{{ entity_name }}Service.cs` | Business operations — validates, persists, dispatches domain events |
| `{{ entity_name }}Validator.cs` | FluentValidation rules per request DTO |
| `{{ entity_name }}Repository.cs` | Data access via `{{ db_context }}` |
| `Dtos/` | Request and response record types |
| `{{ module_name }}.cs` | DI registration — call `Add{{ feature_name }}Module()` from `Program.cs` |

