## Service Flow

```
Request → {{ feature_name }}Controller
        → {{ entity_name }}Validator.ValidateAsync()
        → {{ entity_name }}Service.{method}()
        → {{ entity_name }}Repository.{method}()
        → {{ db_context }}
        ← Result<TResponse>
        ← HTTP response
```

## Key Rules

- All repository reads use `.AsNoTracking()`.
- All methods are `async`.
- Never log PII.
- Cross-feature communication via `IEventDispatcher` only.

## Registration

Add to `Program.cs`:

```csharp
builder.Services.Add{{ feature_name }}Module();
```
